// Replaces the D3D9 DeferredSun pixel shader pass + 224-constant/208-sampler save/restore + DeferredFog::FrameCopy
// StretchRect + DEPTH output (which disables Early-Z). Runs natively at full resolution and RenderScale < 1.0 over
// [viewport.xy, viewport.xy + viewport.zw). Fallback: non-PCF shadow modes and SkylightingMode 1 remain on the D3D9 pass. (2026-11-27
// sunsheen-fade: the sun steps' cross-fade, SunFadeDeferred::Fading, and DeferredWetness's film highlight, DS_WET_FILM, run here too:
// kFlagSunCrossFade / kFlagWetFilm below. 2026-11-28 upstream 1.1.6 merge: DeferredFirstPerson's run, Vm.on, too: kFlagViewModel.)
// Compile: glslangValidator -V --target-env vulkan1.1 -o DeferredSun.spv DeferredSun.comp
